  3. sell, rent, transfer, resell or otherwise use them for any commercial purpose.
The public visibility of this repository does not grant any license. Unauthorized use will be pursued.

Third-party components contained in the firmware (for example the Linux kernel, OpenWrt packages and
the device maker's programs) remain under their own licenses; this notice does not restrict the rights
those licenses grant by law, and applies only to the copyright holder's own work and to the selection,
arrangement and distribution of the firmware as a whole.

The files are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Use at your own risk.
